09:23.870 --> 09:24.750
Ocho.

09:24.910 --> 09:26.470
♪ Mi yo inquieto ♪

09:26.510 --> 09:27.470
Siete.

09:27.690 --> 09:29.370
♪ Bailando al ritmo de la noche ♪

09:29.030 --> 09:29.960
